{"id":"25c37fe51095276d","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-FS.md","title":"Friedman–Sheard 理论 FS","display":"df-FS — Friedman–Sheard 理论 FS","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-FS","aliases":["91-df-FS","91-df-friedman-sheard"],"display":"df-FS — Friedman–Sheard 理论 FS","depends_on":["[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]","[[91-df-capture-axiom]]","[[91-df-release-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-FS"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-FS</span><span>91-df-friedman-sheard</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-FS — Friedman–Sheard 理论 FS"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" href=\"?note=b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" title=\"91-df-compositional-axioms\">91-df-compositional-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" href=\"?note=7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" title=\"91-df-capture-axiom\">91-df-capture-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"efd61e76586d57ab\" href=\"?note=efd61e76586d57ab\" title=\"91-df-release-axiom\">91-df-release-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{cap}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{cap}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{rel}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" href=\"?note=7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" title=\"91-df-capture-axiom\">91-df-capture-axiom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"efd61e76586d57ab\" href=\"?note=efd61e76586d57ab\" title=\"91-df-release-axiom\">91-df-release-axiom</a> 的无假设定理规则。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_T\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T})\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T})\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T})\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T})\\)</span> 为取消类型限制的六个组合公理，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" href=\"?note=b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" title=\"91-df-compositional-axioms\">91-df-compositional-axioms</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL},R}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL},R}\\)</span> 指闭合于经典规则及指定定理规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的最小定理集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}FS}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\mathrm{FSN}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T})),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}FS}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\mathrm{FSN}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T})),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL},\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{cap}}(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T})\\cup\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{rel}}(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T})}(\\mathrm{FSN}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FS}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL},\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{cap}}(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T})\\cup\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{rel}}(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T})}(\\mathrm{FSN}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书的 fsn（没有下标）在此大写为 FSN，以区别有界规则片段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}_n\\)</span>。\nFSN 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall t(T(\\operatorname{tr}(t))\\leftrightarrow T(\\operatorname{val}(t)))\">\\(\\forall t(T(\\operatorname{tr}(t))\\leftrightarrow T(\\operatorname{val}(t)))\\)</span>：这个真理原子双条件与经典否定公理会导致说谎者矛盾。FS 用两条定理规则处理真理迭代。\nFS 一致而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致；有限修正阶段验证有界片段，不能给整个 FS 构造标准模型。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 14.1、14.4，印刷页 145–147，PDF 页 156–158；§14.1。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-compositional-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-capture-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-capture-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-release-axiom","status":"r